// 4xAA 6 V alkaline battery pack (four Energizer E91 / IEC LR6 cells in series in a 4-cell holder).
// Thevenin model: 6.0 V open-circuit EMF (4 * 1.5 V) in series with 0.9 ohm fresh internal
// resistance (4 * 0.225 ohm, midpoint of Energizer E91's 150 to 300 mohm per fresh cell;
// Energizer's Battery Internal Resistance Technical Bulletin fig. 1 measures 0.214 ohm on a
// fresh AA cell). Sustained current rating 1.0 A warns on heavy loads and shorts.
